CORE
main.cpp
--cpp11 --unwind 4
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* private member in braced-init-list argument: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* local in braced list: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] .* initializer_list of a local: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] .* WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
g++ 13 (-fsanitize=address,undefined) and clang++ 18 accept this program,
and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
